        {
          "text": "Daudi o Siba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.9+2SA.9.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 9.9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ake pee egiroo Daudi enchumata o ldoinyo peno, netumore ninye Siba osinka le Mofiboshet, o sirkon are naairotoki, enapita imukateni iip are, o rridat iip loo sabibu ooitoyioki, o rridat iip loo lng'anayio le nkolong, o lbene lo lchoni le naisho oo sabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki olaiguanani Siba, “Kainyoo iyie pee iyaua kuna?” Newal Siba ajo, “Ore kulo sirkon laa ile nkaji o laiguanani pee eked alotie, ore imukateni o lng'anayio naa inoo lbarnot naanya, ore enaisho oo sabibu naa ene lelo ooiterre to lpurkel pee eok.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.19.26+2SA.19.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 19.26-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejo olaiguanani, “Paa koree olayioni lo lkitok lino?” Nejoki Siba olaiguanani, “Ng'ura, etotona te Yerusalem; amu etejo ninye, ‘Taata aaisho nanu enkaji e Israel aashukoki enkitoria e papa lai.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olaiguanani ajoki Siba, “Ng'ura, ore nena apa pooki naara ine Mefiboshet naa nkuninono taata.” Nejo Siba, “Kaasai nanu; nchooki nanu manoto omom too nkonyek inono, olkitok lai olaiguanani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi o Shimei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee elotu Olaiguanani Daudi Bahurim, neipang'u te ine oltung'ani lo lmarei le nkaji e Saul, oji enkarna enye Shimei, olayioni le Gera; naa ore elotu neidikidik adekisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenang Daudi too soito; nenang sii isinkan pooki lo laiguanani Daudi, o ltung'ana pooki, o ltung'ana pooki kituaak ootii enkaina enye e tatene o ene kedienye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Shimei ina kata edekisho, “Shomo, shomo, iyie oltung'ani lo sarge, iyie oltung'ani le pesho! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitalakua Olaitoriani te iyie osarge pooki le nkaji e Saul, laa te wueji enye intoreishe; neishooyie Olaitoriani enkitoria apik atua enkaina o layioni Absalom. Toduaa ajo etii emutata ino shumata ino; amu ira oltung'ani lo sarge.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Abishai olayioni le Seruiya ajoki olaiguanani, “Kainyoo pee edek ele dia otua olkitok lai olaiguanani? Nchooki nanu mashomo adungu endukuya enye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etejo olaiguanani, “Kaa nanu aabaikinore iyie, olayioni le Seruiya? Te nedekisho ninye te nkaraki natiaaka ninye Olaitoriani, ‘Tediaa Daudi,’ kaing'ae naa ojo, ‘Kainyoo pee itaasa iyie ena?’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Daudi Abishai o sinkan lenyena pooki, “Ng'ura, olayioni lai kewan oing'oru enkishui ai; kebaa elusoo ele tung'ani le Benchamen! Tung'uai ninye, naa nchoo ninye edekisho; amu Olaitoriani oishoo ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eidimayu pee eing'or Olaitoriani osina lai, naa kaalaaki nanu Olaitoriani too supati tele deket lena olong.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eshomo Daudi o ltung'ana lenyena te nkoitoi, ina kata eloito Shimei te murte o ldoinyo eipirakinore ninye, nedekisho eloito, nenang ninye too soito neisuaaki enterit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore olaiguanani, o ltung'ana pooki apa ootii te nebo ninye, nebau enaurate Yordan; neyeng'iyeng'a ninye te ine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Absalom te Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa Absalom o ltung'ana pooki, ilewa le Israel nepuonu Yerusalem, o Ahitofel te nebo ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee elotu Hushai, lo losho le Akito ilo shore le Daudi, enetii Absalom, nejoki Hushai Absalom, “Tobikoi olaiguanani! Tobikoi olaiguanani!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Absalom Hushai, “Kena enkanyit ino to lchore lino? Kainyoo pee eitu ilo te nebo olchore lino?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Hushai Absalom, “A-a; amu ore ilo otegelua Olaitoriani o kulo tung'ana o lewa pooki le Israel, olenye aaku nanu, naa te nebo ninye nanu abik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake sii, kaing'ae nanu aisiaai? Aime ilo ayioni lenye? Ore apa anaa enaisiaayia papaai lino, kaaisiaai sii nanu iyie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Absalom Ahitofel, “Nchoru enkikoo ino; kaa iyiook kias?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Ahitofel Absalom, “Shomo iyie atua enetii nkapiak e papaai lino, apa naatung'uayie ninye meing'ura enkaji; pee ening Israel pooki nchere intaa kewan olmang'atinta te papaai lino, ore inkaik e lelo pooki ootii te nebo iyie neitagoli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.12.11+2SA.12.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 12.11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neaku etuunokito ninche Absalom olng'obor te nchumata enkaji; nelo Absalom atua enetii nkapiak e papaai lenye edolita Israel pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa te nena olong'i eutaroto naishoru Ahitofel neikununo ake duoo anaa ororei le Nkai eikilikuanishoreki; keyanyiti apa oleng enkikoo e Ahitofel, Daudi o Absalom, pokira are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
